sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant G as Gateway
  participant S as Service
  participant D as Database
  C->>G: request
  G->>S: forward
  S->>D: query
  D-->>S: rows
  S-->>G: result with order id, customer id, line items, totals, currency, tax lines and the delivery window
  G-->>C: response
